    "name_raw": "Bullseye Shot",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Campaign Setting: Inner Sea Gods",
    "definition_raw": "You slow your breath, calm yourself, and hit the bullseye, just as you were trained to do.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot, base attack bonus +5.\n\nBenefit(s): You can spend a move action to steady your shot. When you do, you gain a +4 bonus on your next ranged attack roll before the end of your turn.\n\nCombat Trick\n\nSource PPC:WMH\n\nNote If using the optional Stamina Pool rules, the following trick may be used with this feat.\n\nCombat Trick: You can spend 5 stamina points to use Bullseye Shot as a swift action.",
